# LIANA cached resources data table
# Four tab-separated columns:
# value	name	description	path
#
# Entries are installed automatically by the LIANA Resources data manager.
# Each path is a directory named from the content-addressed <value>
# and containing <value>.tsv. Existing unversioned installations remain valid.
#
# Example:
# consensus_sha256_<digest>	Consensus (sha256 <short-digest>)	Source consensus; sha256=<digest>	/galaxy/data/liana-db/consensus_sha256_<digest>
# hcop_human_mouse_sha256_<digest>	HCOP Human-Mouse (sha256 <short-digest>)	Source hcop_human_mouse; sha256=<digest>	/galaxy/data/liana-db/hcop_human_mouse_sha256_<digest>
# metalinks_all_sha256_<digest>	Metalinks All (sha256 <short-digest>)	Source metalinks_all; sha256=<digest>	/galaxy/data/liana-db/metalinks_all_sha256_<digest>
